cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ClinAuthBench, please cite this dataset and repository."
title: "ClinAuthBench v1: A Synthetic Inpatient Health Authorization Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  ClinAuthBench is a synthetic inpatient health authorization benchmark. V1
  covers adult inpatient psychiatric authorization over dense 72-hour synthetic
  case documentation, testing whether language models can reason across
  multi-form documentation without asserting unsupported authorization claims.
  Each of the 180 cases carries gold labels, evidence anchors, and an explicit
  set of tempting but unsupported conclusions a model should not claim.
